ISO-10303-21;
HEADER;
/*
  Component:  ISO 4762 - M4 x 10
  Standard:   ISO 4762:2004
  Family:     hexagon socket head cap screw
  Size:       M4
  Length:     10 mm
  Data source: ISO 4762:2004 head/socket table; nominal values, see components/DATA_SOURCES.md
  Notes:      Layered solid: plain shank, head floor, blind hex socket. Socket represented by a ring with a through hex hole over a floor disc. The head is sharp-edged at this detail level. No thread geometry is modeled.
  Features modeled:      head-floor, blind-hex-socket
  Features approximated: head-socket-band (PolygonRevolve, deviation 0.007493768664887823 mm, control circle_segments=48)
  Features omitted:      shank-tip-chamfer (not modelled by this builder); under-head-radius (not modelled by this builder); socket-lead-in-chamfer (not modelled by this builder); head-chamfer (omitted at Simplified detail level); thread (no thread geometry at this detail level)
  Feature tolerance:     0.01 mm
*/
